sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-redux
===============================

A GitHub mirror of the Hugging Face repo:

    https://huggingface.co/Codyfederer/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-redux

Model lineage (all CC BY 4.0):

  - nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
        Base model. Copyright NVIDIA Corporation.
        https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3

  - moondream/parakeet-redux
        1.58-bit (ternary) version of the above. Copyright Moondream.
        https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-redux

  - eschmidbauer/parakeet-redux-onnx
        ONNX export of the ternary weights (4-bit MatMulNBits blocks that
        reproduce -1/0/+1 exactly). Also mirrored at
        github.com/chemcoder-2020/parakeet-redux-onnx

  - Codyfederer/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-redux
        The above repackaged in the sherpa-onnx NeMo TDT layout
        (encoder + split decoder/joiner + tokens + test clips), published as
        sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-redux.tar.bz2. The bundle's own README
        signs the conversion as "Vyvo".

This mirror (github.com/chemcoder-2020/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-redux)
contains a byte-identical copy of the bundle from the source repo above.
The checksum was verified after download and against a fresh clone. The
upstream model card is preserved verbatim in SOURCE-CARD.md.

